 the derivation of molecular symmetry by counting isomers (the benzene
 structure), molecular chirality, the connection between macroscopic and
 molecular chirality, pseudorotation, the symmetry group of nonrigid
 molecules, and the use of orbital symmetry arguments in discussing
 aspects of chemical reactivity.},
